line	
line	<str>Give your sweet food to the Troll child north-west of Trollheim by right-clicking and using the cake on the troll child.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Troll child.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the ice gate and kill 5 ice trolls.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the cave.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the path then kill Kamil (it is advised to approach with protect from magic to force him to teleport into range, then protect from melee, and manually cast your spells).</str>
line	
line	<str>Continue west and follow the long icy path.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wear spiked boots and climb the ice ledge, follow the new path.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the gate and smash the trolls frozen in ice by using your fire spell on each of them. Talk to them for the ice diamond.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Malak</col> in the Canifis pub.</col>
step	30	-	Quick guide step 30
line	<str>Talk to Asgarnia Smith in the Bedabin camp by the magic carpet with at least one inventory slot free.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Digsite Exam Centre and talk to Terry Balando.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again for a translation.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Asgarnia Smith in the desert.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run south to the bandit camp and buy a drink in the pub for 650 coins. (If you are wearing any saradomin or zamorak items e.g. unholy blessing, remove them now so you don't get attacked by the Bandits)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the bartender again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Eblis in or just outside of the small rectangular building east of the bar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Deliver all the required items to Eblis by using them on him (items can remain noted), then talk to him again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south-east to the mirrors, and talk to Eblis there.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip your facemask and enter the Smoke Dungeon west of Pollnivneach and east of the mirrors</str>
line	
line	<str>Light the 4 standing torches, one in each corner of the dungeon, and open the chest in the centre to get the key before any of the torches burns out.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the warm key to open the gate to the east.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill Fareed to get the Smoke diamond. Protect from Melee is strongly advised and attacking with water spell or any range arrow.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Rasolo outside the house south of Baxtorian Falls.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the most southern tent in the Bandit camp. Bring antipoison, food, and 20+ lockpicks (you can bring noted ones and coins to exchange with Tiles in Bandit camp's general store, 5 coins for each lockpick) (For ironmen, note that both lockpicks and antipoisons may be pickpocketed from the Bandits in the vicinity).</str>
line	
line	<str>Unlock the secure chest (the 3 locks must be picked consecutively, it can take upwards of 100 tries to open the chest and is dependent upon Thieving level).</str>
line	
line	<str>Give the gilded cross to Rasolo. Even if your inventory is full, the cross will instantly be swapped for the ring.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the visibility ring and climb down the ladder east of Rasolo in the fenced area.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run through the dungeon, kill Damis in his 2 forms and pick up the shadow diamond (his second form drains player's prayer rapidly, it is advised to safespot Damis, this can be done by hitting a bat or rat and stacking npcs behind). Kill a Shadow Hound to complete a task in the Hard Kandarin Diary.</str>
line	
line	<str>Give your sweet food to the Troll child north-west of Trollheim by right-clicking and using the cake on the troll child.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Troll child.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the ice gate and kill 5 ice trolls.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the cave.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the path then kill Kamil (it is advised to approach with protect from magic to force him to teleport into range, then protect from melee, and manually cast your spells).</str>
line	
line	<str>Continue west and follow the long icy path.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wear spiked boots and climb the ice ledge, follow the new path.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the gate and smash the trolls frozen in ice by using your fire spell on each of them. Talk to them for the ice diamond.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Malak in the Canifis pub.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Travel to the <col=800000>Draynor Sewer</col> and give <col=800000>Ruantun</col> a silver bar for a silver pot.</col>
